ix’s discussion of red light therapy, grounding mats and wellness research, with references and information about the Salem, WI studio.\",   \"url\": \"https://www.matrixmassage.net/post/the-synergistic-power-of-red-light-therapy-and-grounding-mats-a-science-backed-wellness-boost\",   \"image\": {     \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",     \"url\": \"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/e4cc43_72468453f01d4774b4bf50fdf0911a42~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_1003,h_1410,al_c,q_90/e4cc43_72468453f01d4774b4bf50fdf0911a42~mv2.png\",     \"width\": \"1003\",     \"height\": \"1410\"   },   \"publisher\": {     \"@type\": \"Organization\",     \"name\": \"Matrix Massage & Bodywork\",     \"url\": \"https://www.matrixmassage.net\"   } }","custom":false,"disabled":false}],"settings":{"preventAutoRedirect":false,"keywords":[]}},"richContent":{"nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"foo","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"As wellness technology evolves, more people are turning to non-invasive, natural methods to restore balance, reduce inflammation, and accelerate healing. Two powerful tools gaining attention—Red Light Therapy (RLT) and Grounding Mats—offer individual benefits, but when used together, they may enhance one another’s effects.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"djra12","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"uko473","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"So what’s the science behind this dynamic duo? And why are people reporting improved sleep, less pain, faster recovery, and deeper relaxation when combining the two?","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"zz2mg5","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"xagpq6","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Let’s break it down.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"8lloi19949","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"HEADING","id":"6gf0815","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"🚨What is Red Light Therapy?","decorations":[]}}],"headingData":{"level":3,"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"5q24k17","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"hd2vi19","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Red Light Therapy (RLT), also called photobiomodulation, involves the use of red and near-infrared light (typically 600–850 nm) to penetrate the skin and underlying tissues. These wavelengths stimulate the mitochondria—the powerhouse of your cells—to produce more ATP (adenosine triphosphate), which is energy your cells use for healing, detoxing, and regenerating.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"hdrrd22","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"HEADING","id":"4f04w23","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Proven benefits of RLT include:","decorations":[]}}],"headingData":{"level":4,"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"92ljn26","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"BULLETED_LIST","id":"ragpo27","nodes":[{"type":"LIST_ITEM","id":"e7wtw28","nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"vjuck29","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Reduced inflammation and oxidative stress","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}}]},{"type":"LIST_ITEM","id":"gsnca31","nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"s6dmq32","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Enhanced collagen and tissue repair","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}}]},{"type":"LIST_ITEM","id":"a8eu634","nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"s0rbp35","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Faster muscle recovery","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}}]},{"type":"LIST_ITEM","id":"nosap37","nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"szwsr38","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Improved circulation","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}}]},{"type":"LIST_ITEM","id":"mnlpb40","nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"l2nj741","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Pain relief from conditions like arthritis and nerve pain","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}}]}],"bulletedListData":{"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"w0mal44","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"vu7q945","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Science-backed fact:","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"kcr1o19685","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"oeg0i47","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Studies have shown that RLT downregulates COX-2 (cyclooxygenase-2)—an enzyme involved in inflammation. COX-2 is commonly targeted by NSAIDs (like ibuprofen), but red light can naturally reduce its activity without medication.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"i5px949","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"hvj1u50","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"📖 Reference: Hamblin, M.R. (2017). Mechanisms and applications of the anti-inflammatory effects of photobiomodulation. AIMS Biophysics, 4(3), 337–361. ","decorations":[]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"https://doi.org/10.3934/biophy.2017.3.337","decorations":[{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"https://doi.org/10.3934/biophy.2017.3.337","target":"BLANK","rel":{"noreferrer":true}}}},{"type":"UNDERLINE"}]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"vi7y255","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"HEADING","id":"83fai56","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"🌍 What is Grounding?","decorations":[]}}],"headingData":{"level":3,"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"7vkza59","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"nsxrg60","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Grounding (also known as earthing) refers to direct skin contact with the Earth’s surface—or using a grounding mat that connects to the Earth’s electrical field via a grounded outlet.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"bfsnv62","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"mfeb663","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"This practice transfers negatively charged free electrons from the Earth into your body, which can neutralize positively charged free radicals—one of the main causes of chronic inflammation and oxidative stress.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"60d5y66","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"HEADING","id":"xiv5u67","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Proven benefits of grounding include:","decorations":[]}}],"headingData":{"level":4,"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"1ylvj70","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"BULLETED_LIST","id":"idlcn71","nodes":[{"type":"LIST_ITEM","id":"5stzj72","nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"ui20r73","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Decreased inflammation and cortisol levels","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}}]},{"type":"LIST_ITEM","id":"rudw075","nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"k58el76","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Improved heart rate variability (HRV) and parasympathetic activity","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}}]},{"type":"LIST_ITEM","id":"7hik678","nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"omhqk79","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Better sleep and mood","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}}]},{"type":"LIST_ITEM","id":"fi1zb81","nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"dst5m82","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Reduced delayed-onset muscle soreness (DOMS)","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}}]}],"bulletedListData":{"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"r73ip85","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"t68b486","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Science-backed fact:","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"wkfyl19743","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"0hj2j88","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"One peer-reviewed study found that grounding decreased inflammatory markers such as TNF-alpha and IL-6 in subjects who slept on grounding mats for several weeks.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"wxfyx90","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"3hikx91","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"📖 Reference: Chevalier, G., Sinatra, S.T., Oschman, J.L., & Delany, R.M. (2013). Earthing: Health implications of reconnecting the human body to the Earth’s surface electrons. Journal of Environmental and Public Health, 2012, Article ID 291541. ","decorations":[]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"https://doi.org/10.1155/2012/291541","decorations":[{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"https://doi.org/10.1155/2012/291541","target":"BLANK","rel":{"noreferrer":true}}}},{"type":"UNDERLINE"}]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"gvzrp95","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"HEADING","id":"id8b797","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"🔬 Why Combine Red Light Therapy and Grounding?","decorations":[]}}],"headingData":{"level":3,"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"okcxu100","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"a7n1e101","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"These therapies complement each other biologically:","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"IMAGE","id":"rnfrf18995","nodes":[],"imageData":{"containerData":{"alignment":"CENTER"},"image":{"src":{"id":"e4cc43_72468453f01d4774b4bf50fdf0911a42~mv2.png"},"width":1003,"height":1410}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"e3xxy143","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"HEADING","id":"loa11144","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"🧘🏻‍♀️ How to Use Them Together Safely","decorations":[]}}],"headingData":{"level":3,"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"2kswb147","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"BULLETED_LIST","id":"8t5iy148","nodes":[{"type":"LIST_ITEM","id":"ue9vz149","nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"l13h5150","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Use grounding mats on bare skin (feet, back, or arms) while sitting or lying down.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}}]},{"type":"LIST_ITEM","id":"xke09152","nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"ufeji153","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Position your red light panel 6–18 inches from the body, depending on the wavelength and strength.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}}]},{"type":"LIST_ITEM","id":"s6twj155","nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"fcxgj156","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Typical sessions are 10–20 minutes, ideally 3–5x/week.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}}]},{"type":"LIST_ITEM","id":"3odnp158","nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"czo2s159","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Make sure grounding equipment is connected properly to a grounded outlet (use a ground tester )","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}}]}],"bulletedListData":{"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"roudr173","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"HEADING","id":"wr41j174","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"✅ Final Thoughts","decorations":[]}}],"headingData":{"level":3,"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"5nrdi177","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"m3mog178","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"If you’re seeking a natural way to reduce inflammation, recharge your energy, and feel more grounded—literally—this pairing may be worth trying. Clients consistently report a heightened sense of calm, less post-session soreness, and more vitality when these tools are integrated.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"lpgj9180","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"BLOCKQUOTE","id":"de7g5181","nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"qc9ub182","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"“It’s like recharging your body from the inside while plugging it back into nature.”","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}}],"blockquoteData":{"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"pfgsw184","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"lx6sh185","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"To experience this in a session, reach out to Matrix Massage & Bodywork for availability or booking options.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"u7e7d86","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"HEADING","id":"n70vt178","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"⚠️ Legal & Wellness Disclaimer","decorations":[]}}],"headingData":{"level":3,"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"52xkp182","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"These therapies are for wellness support and relaxation. As a licensed massage therapist, I offer red light therapy, NIR and grounding as adjunctive tools for general well-being. They are not medical treatments and should not be used to diagnose or replace medical advice or prescriptions.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"im65q189","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"HEADING","id":"zyyvf190","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"📚 References","decorations":[]}}],"headingData":{"level":3,"textStyle":{"t